# SGS NEXT — Enterprise AI PropTech Platform

Foundation scaffold for a full-stack real-estate ecosystem: public site, AI search,
CRM, Broker Portal, Customer Portal, Admin, CMS, and AI services (RAG/valuation).
Built as an isolated monorepo so it never touches the live `sgsland.vn` production app.

## Status

Phase 1 (this commit): foundation only.
- Monorepo skeleton (`apps/web`, `apps/api`, `packages/db`, `packages/ui`, `packages/config`)
- Complete PostgreSQL data model as Prisma schema (47 models, 13 enums) — validated OK
- Environment variable contract (`docs/.env.example`)
- Reference NestJS module (Properties) proving the Clean Architecture pattern end-to-end

Not yet built: CRM UI, Broker/Customer portals, Admin panel, CMS page builder, AI
assistant service, mortgage/bank integrations, GraphQL layer, CI/CD. These are
planned as incremental verticals (see Roadmap).

